   [170]={next_id=171, abreast_id={}, pType =1, cg_type =10, dialog=1, msg="她嘴唇嗫嚅着，单边的眼镜中隐约映显出另一张你熟悉的脸：深海，她正通过这种方式留意着你们这边的一切动静。", msg_color="", msg_size=0, talker="", audio="", img="arts/ui/bg/story/storybg_ACT201_101.jpg", video_url="", music_id="0", background_music="", model_tid={}, model_pos={}, model_move_pos={}, model_exit={}, model_show_effect={}, update_model={}, role_act={}, head_path="", shake_ani=0, grad_time=0, is_memory=0, roll_str="",roll_bg ="", static_pic ="", prefab_path ="", runTalkTime =0, destoryTime =0, clickTimes =0, effPos={ 0,0,0},effUrl="", waitIDs = {}},
   [171]={next_id=172, abreast_id={}, pType =1, cg_type =10, dialog=1, msg="你迅速移开视线，假装自己从未看到这些，维里塔仿佛没有发现丽娜这边的情况，她的确如同你印象中那般傲慢和不可一世。", msg_color="", msg_size=0, talker="", audio="", img="arts/ui/bg/story/storybg_ACT201_101.jpg", video_url="", music_id="0", background_music="", model_tid={}, model_pos={}, model_move_pos={}, model_exit={}, model_show_effect={}, update_model={}, role_act={}, head_path="", shake_ani=0, grad_time=0, is_memory=0, roll_str="",roll_bg ="", static_pic ="", prefab_path ="", runTalkTime =0, destoryTime =0, clickTimes =0, effPos={ 0,0,0},effUrl="", waitIDs = {}},
   [172]={next_id=173, abreast_id={}, pType =1, cg_type =10, dialog=1, msg="我向您保证，整件事情都会天衣无缝，除了在场之人外，没有谁会知道今天发生的一切。", msg_color="", msg_size=0, talker="维里塔", audio="", img="arts/ui/bg/story/storybg_ACT201_101.jpg", video_url="", music_id="0", background_music="", model_tid={{ 2, "7211", 0, 0, -10.5, 190}}, model_pos={{ 0,0,0}}, model_move_pos={}, model_exit={}, model_show_effect={{}}, update_model={{ 2,1}}, role_act={}, head_path="", shake_ani=0, grad_time=0, is_memory=0, roll_str="",roll_bg ="", static_pic ="", prefab_path ="", runTalkTime =0, destoryTime =0, clickTimes =0, effPos={ 0,0,0},effUrl="", waitIDs = {}},
   [173]={next_id=174, abreast_id={}, pType =1, cg_type =10, dialog=1, msg="<color=blue>我是一个百年前的幽灵，我不在意自己继续潜藏下去。\n您完全可以像当初的伊南姆家族那样，对外宣称我已被处决，哪怕是这具机械的躯体也可以让您带回去交差。\n对您来说，这只是小菜一碟，您手中那个现在已经失效的终端也恰好可以供我临时栖身。</color>", msg_color="", msg_size=0, talker="", audio="", img="arts/ui/bg/story/storybg_ACT201_101.jpg", video_url="", music_id="0", background_music="", model_tid={}, model_pos={}, model_move_pos={}, model_exit={}, model_show_effect={}, page_show_effect={ 0.20, 0, 5, 0, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 873.00, 341.00, 1.00, {}, {}, 1.00}, update_model={}, role_act={}, head_path="", shake_ani=0, grad_time=0, is_memory=0, roll_str="",roll_bg ="", static_pic ="", prefab_path ="", runTalkTime =0, destoryTime =0, clickTimes =0, effPos={ 0,0,0},effUrl="", waitIDs = {}},
   [174]={next_id=175, abreast_id={}, pType =1, cg_type =10, dialog=1, msg="她轻声引诱着你，仿佛所说出的是天大的恩赐。", msg_color="", msg_size=0, talker="", audio="", img="arts/ui/bg/story/storybg_ACT201_101.jpg", video_url="", music_id="0", background_music="", model_tid={}, model_pos={}, model_move_pos={}, model_exit={}, model_show_effect={}, update_model={}, role_act={}, head_path="", shake_ani=0, grad_time=0, is_memory=0, roll_str="",roll_bg ="", static_pic ="", prefab_path ="", runTalkTime =0, destoryTime =0, clickTimes =0, effPos={ 0,0,0},effUrl="", waitIDs = {}},
   [175]={next_id=176, abreast_id={}, pType =1, cg_type =10, dialog=1, msg="<color=blue>假如您愿意在此时完成进化，我乐于看到您接手我的研究并立刻执行。\n您若是不愿意，此时停止它也刚刚好。</color>", msg_color="", msg_size=0, talker="", audio="", img="arts/ui/bg/story/storybg_ACT201_101.jpg", video_url="", music_id="0", background_music="", model_tid={}, model_pos={}, model_move_pos={}, model_exit={}, model_show_effect={}, page_show_effect={ 0.20, 0, 5, 0, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 873.00, 341.00, 1.00, {}, {}, 1.00}, update_model={}, role_act={}, head_path="", shake_ani=0, grad_time=0, is_memory=0, roll_str="",roll_bg ="", static_pic ="", prefab_path ="", runTalkTime =0, destoryTime =0, clickTimes =0, effPos={ 0,0,0},effUrl="", waitIDs = {}},
